  "description": "Charlotte De Perol is a beautiful lady with a heartbreaking past. She has endured long years of abuse and threats from her mother while her father was busy chasing girls and wasting the family’s fortune. But on the day of her grandfather's funeral, Charlotte becomes the countess instead of her father. Out of resentment, cruel father locates his long forgotten daughter named Kara to steal the title back from her daughter Charlotte. \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
